dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.diff
version 1
schema stdio.semio
start body
framing record

# W-S closer (`any`): REAL binary diff frame, replacing the old `print_diff().into_bytes()`
# text-as-binary shortcut. `format u8` + `tag u8` (real diff-variant ordinal,
# `🔺️diff/🦀️.rs`'s `diff_tag`) are genuinely, individually protocol-walkable fixed
# header fields, matching the recipe's §2.5 op/mutation-binary shape (not the presence-bitmask
# diff shape — `SemioDiff` is a genuinely tagged union, one active variant at a time, closer in
# shape to an op enum than to a flat struct-of-optional-fields). Past the header, `payload` is
# the WRAPPED subset's own real `DiffCodec::encode_diff()` bytes (or, for `replace`, the wrapped
# snapshot's own real `ArtifactPack::encode_pack()` bytes) — one opaque trailing chain, the
# `protocol-prim-ref-recursion` gap's honest boundary (one-of-14 heterogeneous nested payloads).
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8

chain payload bytes
